00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:44.640
You need almost nothing to actually get

00:02:43.480 --> 00:02:46.360
going. You don't need a truck,

00:02:44.640 --> 00:02:48.560
equipment, or a license. You need a

00:02:46.360 --> 00:02:50.200
neighborhood, a schedule, and a car to

00:02:48.560 --> 00:02:51.920
get you to the house. And if you can

00:02:50.200 --> 00:02:53.760
build a tight enough route and add

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:55.720
customers, then your recurring revenue

00:02:53.760 --> 00:02:57.280
will continue to stack. Number two is

00:02:55.720 --> 00:02:59.120
